WEBVTT

00:17:29.038 --> 00:17:31.788
a good movie or television show.
But I promise you two things.

00:17:31.788 --> 00:17:35.246
One, you will enjoy the
process of looking

00:17:35.246 --> 00:17:38.371
because you will learn about things that
you would not otherwise learn about.

00:17:38.371 --> 00:17:41.371
And if people are reviewing things
in a way that is compelling,

00:17:41.371 --> 00:17:43.163
that process alone will be entertaining.

00:17:43.163 --> 00:17:46.204
And too, you will find better
things to watch.

00:17:46.329 --> 00:17:49.288
You will have fewer nights where you made
the decision to watch something

00:17:49.288 --> 00:17:51.163
for two hours and at the end of
the two hours you're like,

00:17:51.163 --> 00:17:53.371
that's two hours of my life.
I'm never getting back.

00:17:53.788 --> 00:17:56.121
So there's there's obviously
a huge portion of

00:17:56.121 --> 00:18:00.246
the movie going audience that mainly
watches things like superhero movies